      "string_id": "escape_trader_done_blockpost_box_2",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Good! You were a great help. But, of course a \"thank you\" won't buy you a loaf of bread. Here's three... wait, two thousand pieces of eight and we're square!  By the way, the soldiers will certainly notice something missing, so things are going to heat up. You better get going, and the faster, the better.",
      "JA_current": "よし！ 大いに助かったぞ。だがまあ、「ありがとう」の一言じゃパンの一切れも買えやしないからな。ほら、3,000……いや待て、2,000ルーブルだ、これで貸し借りなしだな！ そうそう、兵隊どもも何かが消えたことに気づくはずだ。ここらもしばらく騒がしくなるぞ。さっさとズラかるんだな、早ければ早いほどいい。",
